# Insights (`@umetrica/insights`)

## Pipeline

1. `detectAnomalies()` — Cube queries, compare 7d vs prior 7d
2. `InsightBrief` — anomaly + drivers + correlations
3. `evaluateInsight()` — DeepSeek/Qwen structured JSON
4. `buildFallbackEvaluation()` — when no API key or LLM fails

## API

- `GET /api/insights` — list by org
- `POST /api/insights/generate` — detect all, evaluate each, store
- `DELETE /api/insights/:id`

## Schemas

`InsightBrief`, `InsightEvaluation`, `Insight` in `packages/core/src/schemas.ts`.

## LLM env

`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`, `QWEN_API_KEY` in root `.env`.
